---
// Put right after a list whose `phone` setting is "swipe" (or a gallery strip): on phones it shows how much of the
// strip is on screen and which way there is more, as an accent bar with an arrow head. Decoration only: the strip
// itself is focusable, labelled and scrolls by touch, trackpad and keyboard. Styles in sections.css; script in
// src/scripts/swipe-cue.js. Without JavaScript the bar sits at the start, pointing right.
---
<div class="swipe-cue" aria-hidden="true"><span class="swipe-cue-bar"></span></div>
<script src="../scripts/swipe-cue.js"></script>
